### Ship Incident API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/ship-incidents
@shipTrackingId = SHIP_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@trackingId = RECORD_TRACKING_ID_HERE

### 1. Create new incident record
POST {{baseUrl}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commercialShipTrackingId": "{{shipTrackingId}}",
  "incidentDate": "2024-11-15T14:30:00",
  "eventType": "INCIDENT",
  "incidentType": "MECHANICAL_FAILURE",
  "severity": "MOYENNE",
  "description": "Engine failure in main propulsion system",
  "maritimeZone": "PORT_AREA",
  "coordinates": "6.1256° N, 1.2224° E",
  "weatherConditions": "Calm sea, light winds",
  "assistanceProvided": "Tugboat assistance",
  "pollutionOccurred": false,
  "status": "EN_COURS"
}

### 2. Update incident record (Path Variable)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/update/{{trackingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commercialShipTrackingId": "{{shipTrackingId}}",
  "incidentDate": "2024-11-15T14:30:00",
  "eventType": "INCIDENT",
  "incidentType": "MECHANICAL_FAILURE",
  "severity": "MOYENNE",
  "description": "Engine failure resolved after maintenance",
  "maritimeZone": "PORT_AREA",
  "coordinates": "6.1256° N, 1.2224° E",
  "weatherConditions": "Calm sea, light winds",
  "assistanceProvided": "Tugboat assistance and technical support",
  "pollutionOccurred": false,
  "status": "RESOLU"
}

### 3. Get specific incident record (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get/{{trackingId}}

### 4. Get all incidents for a ship (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/commercial-ship/{{shipTrackingId}}

### 5. Get ongoing incidents
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/ongoing

### 6. Get by status (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/status/EN_COURS

### 7. Get incidents by period (Path Variables - NEW FORMAT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/period/2024-01-01T00:00:00/2024-12-31T23:59:59

### 8. Get by event type (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/event-type/INCIDENT

### 9. Get by severity (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/severity/GRAVE

### 10. Get incidents with pollution
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/with-pollution

### 11. Get by maritime zone (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/maritime-zone/PORT_AREA

### 12. Get all incident records
GET {{baseUrl}}/list

### 13. Delete incident record (Path Variable)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete/{{trackingId}}
